## REPOSITORY STRUCTURE

When scaffolding the app, use this exact structure:

```
p-spot/
├── index.html                  # Landing page (waitlist)
├── .cursorrules                # This file
├── docs/
│   └── PSpot_Product_Concept.docx
├── app/                        # React Native / Expo app
│   ├── app/                    # Expo Router file-based routing
│   │   ├── (auth)/
│   │   │   ├── login.tsx
│   │   │   └── signup.tsx
│   │   ├── (tabs)/
│   │   │   ├── index.tsx       # Home — map view
│   │   │   ├── stream.tsx      # The Stream feed
│   │   │   ├── submit.tsx      # Submit a spot
│   │   │   ├── leaderboard.tsx
│   │   │   └── profile.tsx
│   │   ├── spot/[id].tsx       # Spot detail screen
│   │   ├── badges.tsx
│   │   ├── level.tsx
│   │   ├── notifications.tsx
│   │   ├── settings.tsx
│   │   └── _layout.tsx
│   ├── components/             # Shared UI components
│   ├── lib/
│   │   ├── supabase.ts         # Supabase client
│   │   ├── claude.ts           # Claude API scoring + moderation
│   │   ├── strava.ts           # Strava OAuth + activity fetch
│   │   ├── exif.ts             # EXIF extraction via exifr
│   │   └── mapbox.ts           # Mapbox helpers
│   ├── hooks/                  # Custom React hooks
│   ├── stores/                 # Zustand state stores
│   ├── types/                  # TypeScript types
│   └── constants/
│       ├── scoring.ts          # Scoring weights and thresholds
│       └── levels.ts           # Level names and XP thresholds
└── supabase/
    ├── migrations/             # SQL migration files
    └── functions/              # Supabase Edge Functions
```

