## DATABASE SCHEMA

### waitlist
```sql
create table waitlist (
  id           bigserial primary key,
  first_name   text not null,
  last_name    text not null,
  email        text not null unique,
  signed_up_at timestamptz not null default now()
);
```

### users (extends Supabase auth.users)
```sql
create table profiles (
  id            uuid primary key references auth.users(id) on delete cascade,
  username      text unique not null,
  display_name  text,
  avatar_url    text,
  level         integer not null default 1,
  xp            integer not null default 0,
  strava_token  text,                        -- encrypted
  strikes       integer not null default 0,
  is_banned     boolean not null default false,
  created_at    timestamptz not null default now()
);
```

### spots
```sql
create table spots (
  id              uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id         uuid not null references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  image_url       text not null,
  share_token     text unique not null default gen_random_uuid()::text,  -- for private share links
  privacy         text not null default 'public'
                  check (privacy in ('public', 'streamers', 'private')),

  -- location
  lat             float8 not null,
  lng             float8 not null,
  altitude_ft     float4,
  location_name   text,

  -- base scores
  score_total     float4,
  score_view      float4,
  score_elevation float4,
  score_remoteness float4,
  score_lighting  float4,

  -- bonus scores
  bonus_skyline     float4 default 0,
  bonus_sunrise     float4 default 0,
  bonus_wildlife    float4 default 0,
  bonus_girth       float4 default 0,
  bonus_hydration   float4 default 0,
  bonus_danger      float4 default 0,
  bonus_effort      float4 default 0,
  bonus_toilet      float4 default 0,

  -- ai output
  score_tier      text,
  ai_quote        text,
  wildlife_detected boolean default false,

  -- strava
  strava_activity_id  bigint,
  strava_distance_mi  float4,
  strava_elevation_ft float4,
  strava_duration_sec integer,
  strava_suffer_score integer,

  -- engagement
  shake_count     integer not null default 0,
  drip_count      integer not null default 0,

  -- moderation
  moderation_pass boolean,

  submitted_at    timestamptz not null default now()
);
```

### followers
```sql
create table followers (
  follower_id  uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  following_id uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  created_at   timestamptz default now(),
  primary key (follower_id, following_id)
);
```

### shakes (likes)
```sql
create table shakes (
  user_id  uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  spot_id  uuid references spots(id) on delete cascade,
  created_at timestamptz default now(),
  primary key (user_id, spot_id)
);
```

### drips (comments)
```sql
create table drips (
  id         uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id    uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  spot_id    uuid references spots(id) on delete cascade,
  body       text not null,
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);
```

### badges
```sql
create table badges (
  id          text primary key,    -- e.g. 'first_drop', 'golden_stream'
  name        text not null,
  description text,
  is_progress boolean default false  -- true = has a progress bar
);

create table user_badges (
  user_id    uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  badge_id   text references badges(id),
  progress   float4 default 0,     -- 0.0–1.0 for progress badges
  earned_at  timestamptz,          -- null until fully earned
  primary key (user_id, badge_id)
);
```

### notifications
```sql
create table notifications (
  id         uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(),
  user_id    uuid references profiles(id) on delete cascade,
  type       text not null,  -- 'shake','drip','badge','leaderboard','new_streamer'
  payload    jsonb,
  read       boolean default false,
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);
```

---

## SCORING SYSTEM

Scores are UNCAPPED. No ceiling. Ever.

### Base score (out of 70)
- View quality:   0–25 pts
- Elevation:      0–20 pts (scaled, sea level = 0, 14k+ ft = 20)
- Remoteness:     0–15 pts
- Lighting:       0–10 pts (golden hour / sunrise / sunset multiplier)

### Bonus points (additive)
- Skyline detail:      0–8 pts
- Sunrise/sunset:      +5 pts (confirmed via EXIF timestamp + GPS)
- Wildlife easter egg: 0–8 pts
- Stream girth:        0–5 pts
- Hydration score:     0–5 pts (color analysis)
- Danger score:        0–8 pts
- Effort bonus:        0–10 pts (via Strava — distance + elevation gain)
- Special toilet:      0–10 pts (replaces scenic for toilet submissions)

### Streak
Streaks do NOT affect individual spot scores.
Streaks only contribute to XP for leveling. Never mix these.

### Score tiers (approximate guidance, not hard cutoffs)
- 0–40:   Average Relief
- 41–55:  Decent Drainage
- 56–69:  Solid Stream
- 70–79:  Peak Performer
- 80–89:  Elite Peak Releaser
- 90–99:  Cascade Commander
- 100+:   Legendary — log and celebrate these

---

## PRIVACY SYSTEM

Every spot has a privacy field: 'public' | 'streamers' | 'private'

| Setting     | Map | Leaderboard | Stream | Share link |
|-------------|-----|-------------|--------|------------|
| public      | ✓   | ✓           | ✓      | ✓          |
| streamers   | ✗   | score only  | followers only | ✓  |
| private     | ✗   | ✗           | ✗      | ✓ (owner-generated only) |

Share links use the spot's share_token (UUID). They are never guessable.
Viewing a private spot via share link does NOT make it appear anywhere on the app.
Privacy can be changed post-submission from the spot detail screen.

