## SOCIAL VOCABULARY — USE THESE TERMS EVERYWHERE IN UI COPY

| Concept         | Term          |
|-----------------|---------------|
| Feed            | The Stream    |
| Submissions     | Spots         |
| Likes           | Shakes        |
| Comments        | Drips         |
| Followers       | Streamers     |
| Following       | In your Stream|

Do not use "likes", "comments", "followers", or "posts" anywhere in user-facing copy.

